MANUAL_ONLY=true
TITLE=E2E-67: Global env pricing for the LLM_MODEL (#233)
TAGS=cost,pricing,selfhosted
MODE=dashboard
BODY=On a self-hosted Bedrock server whose LLM_MODEL is an application-inference-profile ARN, set LLM_MODEL_INPUT_PRICE_PER_1M / LLM_MODEL_OUTPUT_PRICE_PER_1M and confirm per-PR Est. cost + dashboard spend appear with no .mergewatch.yml, that inline replies are priced too, that a per-repo pricing: entry overrides the env price, that 0/0 is priced $0, and that a partial/invalid pair yields one warn and stays unpriced. No fixture PR.
